'''Psykk bat (6)''' is a [[food]] item made by using [[raw psykk bat (6)]] on a [[fire]] within the [[Chambers of Xeric]]. Eating a psykk bat heals the player for 23 [[hitpoints]].

Cooking psykk bat yields 28 [[Cooking]] [[experience]], and requires a Cooking level of 90.

A variable number of psykk bats can also be obtained in the [[Thieving]] puzzle room. One of the [[chest (Chambers of Xeric)|chests]] in the room always contains a one-time loot of psykk bats; one bat per person in the raid when the chest is opened, with a minimum of 5 and a maximum of 25.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1494305447360221184|date=7 February 2022|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/108594|archivedate=9 April 2022}}

